            <title>[IGNITE-10809] IgniteClusterActivateDeactivateTestWithPersistence.testActivateFailover3 fails in master</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10809</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test logic involves independent activation two sets of nodes and then their join into a single cluster.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After introducing BaselineTopology concept in 2.4 version this action became prohibited to enforce data integrity.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test should be refactored to take this into account.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
